Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] P6.1 inn menu plates hang from the 16:9 right edge

The inn menu (createInn, in the engine, opened over the field by the inn
keepers) draws its panels at the 4:3 positions: the money bar, the question
plate (the price and "You don't have enough BIT!") and the Yes / No panel
hang from the right edge, so in the 16:9 field their ends floated 53 px
inside the picture. The money bar and the Yes / No panel (with the money,
the two answers, the cursor and the open pivots) move to the right edge
(DW3_MENU_RIGHT), and the question plate keeps its start and runs to the
edge (DW3_MENU_EXTEND). The inn's name plate is inside the picture. Drawing
only; off (gutter 0) every position is the PS1 one.

